    <briefdescription>
<para>Implements an individual growth model using the von Bertalanffy equation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class models the growth of an individual using the von Bertalanffy growth function. It inherits from <ref refid="class_individual_growth_model" kindref="compound">IndividualGrowthModel</ref> and provides methods to adjust parameters, calculate length at a given age, and access key model parameters such as Linf and T0. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
